  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Chang'e** (1 other source): The performance of Chang'e included quotes from the song Witchcraft [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Chang'e**: rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **Dirt**: rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n- **God Is Calling Me Back Home**: rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **The Silver Cord**: rare: 13 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2024-11-02.bandcampbootlegger** (recommended): soundboard; 17 songs; 127 min [1]\n- **kglw2024-11-02**: source not stated; 3 songs; 125 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2024-11-02.bandcampbootlegger**: taped by Sam Joseph, Joe Santarpia, Grace Reader, Gaspard De Meulemeester; transferred by KGLW.net; source: SBD [1]\n- **kglw2024-11-02**: taped by puffanug; transferred by puffanug; source: ADK Thor > PMD661 > 24/96 wav [2]. Also: Audio captured using ADK T7 THORs in ORTF/cardioid, positioned near the front of house; The recording was made on an Oade concert mod Marantz PMD661 [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by BerryLittles: [Official Poster King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard The Rady Shell At Jacobs Park San Diego, CA Nov 2 2024 t-shirt, hoodi](https://berrylittles.com/product/official-poster-king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-the-rady-shell-at-jacobs-park-san-diego-ca-nov-2-2024-t-shirt/) [4]",
